Subject: [PATCH 28/41] keyboard-typing

CDP human keyboard-typing session (Input.dispatchKeystrokes).

Riders (one file, one commit): input_handler.{cc,h} and Input.pdl also carry
the Input.dispatchMousePath dispatch, and input_handler the cursor-overlay
member. protocol_config.json also registers dispatchMousePath and the Page
agent-snapshot commands. content/browser/BUILD.gn also lists the
cdp_cursor_overlay sources and the browser_switches/buildflags deps.
